array maximum / bandwidth (bytes/s) / 11.75GB
Prefix Sum / Elements per second / 11.26 Billion Elements per second
Matrix Multiplication / FLOPs per second / 6.73 GFLOPs/s 
Merge Sort / Elements per second / 46.71 Million Elements per second
